+
+| Model | Repo / file | Bytes | sha256 |
+| --- | --- | ---: | --- |
+| Bonsai 2 27B (target) | `prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf` / `Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-Q2_0.gguf` | 7,626,008,928 | `4f99aed01b8a877e153f9aa6569a4440fe17c59701cc0953e36d7f460549e70e` |
